_publ_section_synopsis
;
A new phase in the quaternary system K~2~O--Na~2~O--CaO--SiO~2~ with idealized
composition (K~1.5~Na~0.5~)Ca~3~Si~3~O~10~ has been structurally
characterized. The results indicate the existence of a solid-solution series
K~2--~<i>~x~</i>Na<i>~x~</i>Ca~3~Si~3~O~10~.
;
